WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.620
Your health starts with the little things you do every day.

2
00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:13.070
Our everyday behaviour shapes our health: how much we move, what we eat, whether we smoke and how much alcohol we drink.

3
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:21.620
On Health Habit Hub, you can share your own habits and inspire someone else.

4
00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:27.570
Explore what people in the community are trying, and see how their habits connect with one another.

5
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:33.480
You might discover a new idea that fits your everyday life and make it your own.

6
00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:39.240
Keep track of what you repeat and the everyday situations that go along with it.

7
00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:45.240
With each entry, your pattern becomes clearer, so you can see how your habit develops.

8
00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:52.743
Repeating a behaviour in a familiar setting can help it feel more natural, until it becomes part of your routine.

9
00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:57.110
Discover what shapes your everyday life, with Health Habit Hub.
